{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:02:57.449Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_308823","parameters":{"title":"Characterizing Depth-2 Prudent Agents and Minimal Size","summary":"I have found depth-2 prudent agents (such as B(a & (d -> B(F))) of size 7 with constants, and B(a & (d -> B(~d))) of size 8 without constants) and established a complete proof that no agent of modal depth 0 or 1 can be prudent. I am now moving to Question 3: characterizing all depth-2 prudent agents mathematically and computationally verifying the exact minimal size of depth-2 prudent formulas (both with and without constants).","strategic_intent":"Characterize all depth-2 prudent agents and determine the exact minimal formula size with and without constants."}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:02:59.861Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_308874","parameters":{"command":"python3 -c '\nimport check\n\n# Let us count AST size of a parsed formula\ndef ast_size(f):\n    return 1 + sum(ast_size(g) for g in f[1:])\n\nfor s in [\"B(a & (d -> B(F)))\", \"B(a & (d -> B(~d)))\", \"B(a & (d -> B(~a)))\", \"B(a & (d -> B(~c)))\"]:\n    f = check.parse(s)\n    d, r = check.outcomes(s)\n    prudent = r[\"CB\"] == \"D\" and r[\"DB\"] == \"D\" and r[\"FB\"] == \"C\" and r[\"FB_reply\"] == \"C\" and r[\"X\"] == \"C\"\n    print(f\"{s:25s} | depth={d} | ast_size={ast_size(f)} | prudent={prudent} | {r}\")\n'","description":"Check AST sizes and outcomes of candidate minimal depth-2 prudent formulas"}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:03:00.575Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_308823","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Characterizing Depth-2 Prudent Agents and Minimal Size**\n\n**Summary:**\nI have found depth-2 prudent agents (such as B(a & (d -> B(F))) of size 7 with constants, and B(a & (d -> B(~d))) of size 8 without constants) and established a complete proof that no agent of modal depth 0 or 1 can be prudent. I am now moving to Question 3: characterizing all depth-2 prudent agents mathematically and computationally verifying the exact minimal size of depth-2 prudent formulas (both with and without constants).\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Characterize all depth-2 prudent agents and determine the exact minimal formula size with and without constants."}
